codingChallenge.problem_statement:
Implement a FastReportFormatter class with a method:
public static String formatNumbers(int[] numbers)
that formats an array of integers into '[num1 | num2 | ... | numN]' using a single StringBuilder with precalculated capacity.

codingChallenge.starter_code:
public class FastReportFormatter {
    public static String formatNumbers(int[] numbers) {
        if (numbers == null || numbers.length == 0) return "[]";
        StringBuilder sb = new StringBuilder(numbers.length * 8);
        sb.append("[");
        for (int i = 0; i < numbers.length; i++) {
            sb.append(numbers[i]);
            if (i < numbers.length - 1) sb.append(" | ");
        }
        sb.append("]");
        return sb.toString();
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int[] test = {10, 20, 30};
        System.out.println(formatNumbers(test));
    }
}

